---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Terms | Cyber Pirate Labs"
  description="Draft terms for the Cyber Pirate Labs website and illustrative agent experiences. Owner review required before reliance."
>
  <section class="page-intro legal-page">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Cyber Pirate Labs / Website information</p>
      <p class="flag"><strong>Owner review required.</strong> These are draft terms for the website, not a customer agreement and not legal advice. Do not treat them as final.</p>
      <h1>Terms</h1>
      <p>This website is published by Cyber Pirate Labs, LLC to explain CPL AI Voice Agents and CPL AI Chat Agents. CPL configures, implements, connects, tests, and manages these services around agreed business information and workflows.</p>
      <h2>The website and illustrative experiences</h2>
      <p>You may read the pages and use the illustrative voice and chat walkthroughs. They use fictional businesses and sample data. They do not make calls, record audio, contact a live AI model, send inquiries to a team, create appointments, or perform customer work. A simulated team-review state represents an example next step.</p>
      <h2>Demo requests</h2>
      <p>The request form stores an inquiry when verification and storage are configured and the server confirms the save. Archive and notification delivery are separate steps with separate status. An inquiry does not create an account, book a meeting, start a subscription, or form a contract. Do not submit another person’s private information or sensitive customer records, payment details, passwords, or credentials.</p>
      <h2>Service scope</h2>
      <p>Voice and chat services are configured around approved business information, tone, qualification questions, routing, and escalation rules. Stammer AI is the selected underlying platform; CPL does not claim ownership of that platform or its underlying models and infrastructure.</p>
      <p>Phone setup, transfers, recording, supported integrations, and booking behavior require an agreed scope and testing. Providing a booking link is different from creating an appointment through a connected system. Descriptions on this site do not promise universal compatibility, complete accuracy, guaranteed bookings, or a response time.</p>
      <p>Implementation, ongoing management, pricing, usage allowances, support, timing, and data-processing arrangements are discussed separately. A reviewed customer agreement would govern any commissioned service. This website does not publish fixed service packages or prices.</p>
      <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Do not misuse the request form, attempt to read other people’s inquiries, or interfere with the site. Operator access is private.</p>
      <h2>Liability</h2>
      <p>The website and its examples explain a service and illustrate possible workflows. Until a reviewed customer agreement exists, do not rely on this draft for risk allocation or contractual commitments.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/demo/">Request a CPL Demo <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
